---
permalink: /start-an-appraisal/
title: Start an Appraisal | Gary Germer & Associates
description: "Tell us about your item and Gary Germer & Associates will help you determine whether a free spot check, verbal evaluation, or full written appraisal is right for you."
ogTitle: Start an Appraisal | Gary Germer & Associates
ogDescription: "Please fill out our form so Gary and his team can determine whether or not you should invest in a full appraisal."
ogImage: /assets/images/art/start-appraisal-hero-leather.jpg
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

  <!-- ============================== HERO ==============================
       Two-column, like the estate-sales/appraisals/consignment heroes —
       but the real intake form runs 7 fields (incl. a required message +
       required photo upload), too tall for the fixed 100svh .sale-hero,
       so this uses the .sale-hero--tall modifier to let the section grow
       to fit instead of clipping into the header. -->
  <section class="hero sale-hero sale-hero--tall" id="appraisal-hero">
    <div class="hero-media">
      {% art "start-appraisal-hero-leather", "100vw", "", "eager" %}
    </div>
    <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="hero-shell sale-hero-shell">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-dark" data-tier-eyebrow>Start an Appraisal</p>
        <h1 class="hero-heading" data-tier-heading>Let&rsquo;s See If You Need an Appraisal</h1>
        <span class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="hero-lead hero-lead-compact" data-tier-lead>Tell us about your item and we&rsquo;ll help you determine which level of appraisal you actually need. Every appraisal is handled by licensed, bonded, and insured experts, and our written reports are prepared to USPAP standards &mdash; the benchmark relied on by the IRS and accepted in federal and state courts.</p>

        <div class="hero-trust">
          <div class="hero-trust-badges">
            <img class="hero-trust-seal" src="/assets/images/logos/badge-licensed-bonded-insured-white.png" width="162" height="161" loading="lazy" alt="Licensed, Bonded, Insured">
            <img src="/assets/images/logos/badge-uspap-white.png" width="299" height="105" loading="lazy" alt="USPAP — Uniform Standards of Professional Appraisal Practice">
            <img src="/assets/images/logos/badge-irs-compliant-white.png" width="423" height="77" loading="lazy" alt="IRS Compliant">
          </div>
          <p class="hero-trust-stat"><strong>More than 10,000 families</strong> have trusted Gary Germer &amp; Associates &mdash; including trusts, attorneys, and fiduciaries across the Pacific Northwest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-form-card sale-info-bar" id="appraisal-form">
        <h2 data-tier-form-heading>Start an Appraisal</h2>
        <form class="form-grid" action="/api/submit-inquiry" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate>
          <input type="hidden" name="form" value="appraisal">
          <div class="form-honey" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="appraisal-company">Leave this field empty</label>
            <input type="text" id="appraisal-company" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-first-name">First Name</label>
              <input id="appraisal-first-name" name="first_name" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required>
              <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please enter your first name.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-last-name">Last Name</label>
              <input id="appraisal-last-name" name="last_name" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" required>
              <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please enter your last name.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-email">Email</label>
              <input id="appraisal-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
              <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please enter a valid email.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="appraisal-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-tier">Which appraisal service are you interested in?</label>
            <select id="appraisal-tier" name="Appraisal Tier" required>
              <option value="" selected disabled>Select One&hellip;</option>
              <option>Not sure &mdash; help me decide</option>
              <option>Free Spot Check</option>
              <option>Verbal Evaluation</option>
              <option>Full Written Appraisal</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-message">Provide a complete description (dimensions, inscriptions, etc.)</label>
            <textarea id="appraisal-message" name="message" rows="3" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label" for="appraisal-photos">Photos / Attachments</label>
            <div class="field-file">
              <input id="appraisal-photos" name="attachment" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple required>
            </div>
            <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please attach at least one photo.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="form-submit-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <button class="button button-navy" type="submit" data-tier-button>Submit Your Request</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================ DISCOVERY ============================ -->
  {% set signupSubject = "Start an Appraisal page" %}
  {% include "partials/discovery-band.njk" %}

{% endblock %}
